  "assumptions": [
   "Power: about 4400 per arm detects 0.06 at 80% power for Messages 15 and 20 (observed +0.063); Message 2 (-0.171) needs only about 550 per arm. Total about 22,000 across five arms.",
   "Equal allocation, Holm correction across four contrasts, same pre-trust-adjusted model as the source.",
   "Lucid panel with the source screener; compensation per panel standard.",
   "Scale items use the source six-item wording paraphrased; exact wording should be copied from the source instrument."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "Original video files for Messages 2, 15, 20 and 26 must be supplied by the research team.",
   "IRB number and compensation are to be supplied.",
   "The exact source scale item wording must be confirmed."
